あれはね、でもね、思ったより人気だったから、
That one, well, it turned out way more popular than I thought, so

383
00:52:04,980 --> 00:52:09,580
今回みんながこうやって見れるライブで初めて披露したよ！
this time I debuted it for the first time in a live stream where everyone can watch like this!

384
