[Title: Correlation Between "Goods" and "T-shirts" YMD News]

398
00:53:35,080 --> 00:53:38,080
ラプラスさんのグッズで今回Tシャツが出るそうなんですが
I hear T-shirts are coming out as part of Laplus-san's goods this time, but

399
00:53:40,080 --> 00:53:43,080
まことに遺憾です。残念です。
most regrettable. It's a shame.

